    /\ jobCP_f' = [jobCP_f EXCEPT !.client = [client EXCEPT ![s][t].binding = resourceEnv[s], ![s][t].pc = "snapshotted"]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<net, pJobCP>>

\* app_common/job_launcher/process_launcher.py:157-160; private/fed/client/client_executor.py:360-360  [joint spawn: publishes the launch generation; alive is the CJ's]
ProcessJobLauncherSpawn(s) ==
